WEBVTT

00:00.600 --> 00:05.617
People have always found faster
ways to share what they know,

00:05.657 --> 00:09.928
by letter and by pigeon, by
telegraph, press, radio,

00:09.968 --> 00:11.420
screen, and inbox.

00:11.760 --> 00:16.743
Yet inside a company, knowledge
still arrives in pieces,

00:16.783 --> 00:21.765
in inboxes, contracts, systems,
and people’s experience.

00:21.805 --> 00:26.250
And every AI chat sees only
the slice it is given.

00:35.460 --> 00:38.656
HAI Seed builds your company’s own AI.

00:38.696 --> 00:43.510 line:8%
Your company knowledge is kept
on a computer you control.

00:44.000 --> 00:46.814
It connects your history, your systems,

00:46.854 --> 00:51.133 line:8%
and your team’s know-how with
the outside world you choose,

00:51.173 --> 00:55.085
and understands how it all
relates. Who promised what,

00:55.125 --> 00:57.720
what was decided, which rules apply.

00:58.210 --> 01:01.700 line:8%
Then it keeps working,
without waiting to be asked.

01:01.740 --> 01:05.438 line:8%
When the market moves, it
sees which customers, plans,

01:05.478 --> 01:07.307
and commitments it touches,

01:07.347 --> 01:09.592
reasons across the whole company,

01:09.632 --> 01:13.330
and prepares the next move
with the people who own it.

01:13.370 --> 01:15.960 line:8%
What needs your judgment comes to you.

01:22.150 --> 01:24.135
This is the foundation.

01:24.175 --> 01:29.240
Your company’s knowledge kept
current under rules you set.

01:29.630 --> 01:33.996
AI reasons with the whole
picture, acts through your tools,

01:34.036 --> 01:36.460
checks the result, and remembers.

01:36.950 --> 01:42.820
Build on it in plain words.
Agents, automations, chatbots.

01:43.220 --> 01:47.599
Each one starts from what
your company already knows.

01:47.639 --> 01:50.100
How far it grows is up to you.

01:56.890 --> 02:00.786 line:8%
Models will change. Tools will change.

02:00.826 --> 02:05.655 line:8%
New colleagues will join.
The foundation stays.

02:05.695 --> 02:08.970
And it keeps growing. Every day.

02:09.610 --> 02:13.540
HAI Seed. Your company’s own AI.
